            <ArticleTitle>The nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory analgesics.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>14-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The NSAID's are exciting and interesting new analgesics; diclofenac and ketorolac seem to be especially promising for post-operative use. Perhaps the real potential of the NSAID's is that they are an additional way of interrupting the pain pathway to produce analgesia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
